      "title": "Choosing to stay sharp",
      "gist": "Just as industrialization made physical strength optional, AI will make sharp thinking a matter of choice rather than necessity."
    },
    "n0028": {
      "id": "n0028",
      "depth": 2,
      "parent": "n0027",
